plication/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788571030445200204,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"cef8bb65-d066-4996-8f9b-8ba384468a6d","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"0e15-a2f2-76e1-4ccd"},{"link_uuid":"3d8df97c-c237-4e29-a860-d18de75f31b3","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"9479-0ec6-bb65-428d"},{"link_uuid":"e147fdaa-c417-426c-9a71-ab5bdff11ee2","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"f11d-61b5-b06c-4c53"},{"link_uuid":"5efc060e-b6fd-445f-9dfc-2933058bbbc1","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"78cd-62d1-8c80-42de"},{"link_uuid":"a5083a53-e154-4443-bdba-982c87ea73d7","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"cd29-ba08-4fa5-442a"},{"link_uuid":"04c3db8f-4884-40eb-a282-f811bfb0ed8b","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"1a6a-405a-1bb0-4ae9"},{"link_uuid":"92bf55be-9b6b-4252-ad38-acb105b7334f","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"0d84-efab-9822-4afc"},{"link_uuid":"712e2e20-d520-4cf6-ad31-57bfa00aabda","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"3694-596c-7e64-4bce"},{"link_uuid":"2eaa0c45-e357-4838-902f-87d1d3b501ee","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"e860-2191-8a29-4e8e"},{"link_uuid":"5213da19-44b6-43a7-99dd-3ffa7e0a0710","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"4ba4-a5dc-1e9d-4b3a"},{"link_uuid":"0964f1b9-adb6-4c08-a5d8-ab8010d3b778","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"ea64-4472-fbc4-4142"},{"link_uuid":"7f2a8971-5622-4b0f-9546-302760be33cc","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"e12b-91c9-24ac-4782"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/integration cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/integration/s3_doctor_harness.py:1-21` — Preserve real Git-bundle model, injected S3 surface, and lossless-heal oracle. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/integration/test_b636_rebuild_history_loss.py:1-12, 279-282` — Preserve snapshot-only state, retired-source recovery, and per-UUID history fallback. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/integration/test_bare_repository_fixture_portability_heldout.py:1-71` — Preserve `safe.bareRepository=explicit` behavior, accepted `--git-dir` form, scanner scope, and exclusions. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/integration/test_concurrency_regression.py:1-19, 79-90, 102-112, 121-142, 148-164, 324-330, 422-426, 442-456, 804-813, 1054-1061, 1325-1328, 1374-1380, 1420-1425, 1492-1501, 1506-1517, 1619-1634, 1665-1676, 1721-1724, 1755-1767, 1851-1855, 1876-1880, 1904-1924, 2190-2198` — Preserve deterministic barriers, union/convergence invariants, exact fork winners, repair ordering, parent-cascade races, and append-only history. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/integration/test_ensure_project_mapping.py:1-17` — Preserve seed/stamp effects and no-per-ticket-event migration invariant. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/integration/test_id_collision.py:1-19` — Preserve canonical-ID shape, deterministic aliases, and meaningful collision checks. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/integration/test_prepare_reclaim_backup.py:639-656` — Preserve requirement that template-copy source remotes have no active detached upkeep. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/integration/test_reconcile_live_e2e.py:1-42, 59-67, 84-92, 328-334, 394-412, 462-476, 523-529, 571-577, 595-606` — Preserve bilateral cleanup, xdist confinement, import isolation, fresh-client polling, eventual-consistency budget, and memoization regression oracle. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/integration/test_s3_doctor_heldout.py:1-21` — Preserve the held-out edge-case inventory and non-implementation exposure. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/integration/test_s3_doctor.py:1-15, 131-139, 203-209` — Preserve lossless heal, bounded transient retry, and published-ref targeting. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/integration/test_s3_preflight.py:1-14` — Preserve fail-closed requirement and required helper capability. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/integration/test_store_concurrency.py:1-19, 131-135` — Preserve concurrent-writer zero-loss/fsck oracle. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest --collect-only tests/integration/s3_doctor_harness.py tests/integration/test_b636_rebuild_history_loss.py tests/integration/test_bare_repository_fixture_portability_heldout.py tests/integration/test_concurrency_regression.py tests/integration/test_ensure_project_mapping.py tests/integration/test_id_collision.py tests/integration/test_prepare_reclaim_backup.py tests/integration/test_reconcile_live_e2e.py tests/integration/test_s3_doctor_heldout.py tests/integration/test_s3_doctor.py tests/integration/test_s3_preflight.py tests/integration/test_store_concurrency.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/integration/s3_doctor_harness.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_b636_rebuild_history_loss.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_bare_repository_fixture_portability_heldout.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_concurrency_regression.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_ensure_project_mapping.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_id_collision.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_prepare_reclaim_backup.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_reconcile_live_e2e.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_s3_doctor_heldout.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_s3_doctor.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_s3_preflight.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_store_concurrency.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2d43-3c39-307e-4450